<!-- When we make sense -->
<section class="bg-surface-container-low py-20 px-8">
<div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
<h2 class="font-headline text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-4 tracking-tighter">When paying us makes more sense than DIY</h2>
<p class="text-on-surface-variant max-w-2xl mb-10">California's <a href="https://byebyemattress.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-primary underline">Bye Bye Mattress</a> program recycles mattresses for free if you can drop them off. Your city trash hauler does one or two free bulky pickups a year. If either works for you, do that; it's cheap, and the fee's already baked into the price you paid for the mattress. We made the case for it in our <a href="/posts/mattress-disposal-san-diego.html" class="text-primary underline">full mattress disposal guide</a>. But here's when calling us is actually the right move:</p>
<div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
<div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-8 rounded-xl ring-1 ring-outline-variant/20">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-3xl mb-4">schedule</span>
<h3 class="font-headline text-lg font-bold mb-2">You need it gone this week</h3>
<p class="text-sm text-on-surface-variant">Bulky pickup programs book 2-4 weeks out. Drop-off sites require time and a truck. We show up in a day or two.</p>
</div>
<div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-8 rounded-xl ring-1 ring-outline-variant/20">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-3xl mb-4">stairs</span>
<h3 class="font-headline text-lg font-bold mb-2">It's not on the ground floor</h3>
<p class="text-sm text-on-surface-variant">Third-floor walkups, loft beds, awkward staircases. We come inside and get it.</p>
</div>
<div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-8 rounded-xl ring-1 ring-outline-variant/20">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-3xl mb-4">bed</span>
<h3 class="font-headline text-lg font-bold mb-2">Multiple mattresses</h3>
<p class="text-sm text-on-surface-variant">One is cheap at the drop-off. Four from a tenant turnover, plus frames and furniture, is better bundled into one load with us.</p>
</div>
<div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-8 rounded-xl ring-1 ring-outline-variant/20">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-3xl mb-4">block</span>
<h3 class="font-headline text-lg font-bold mb-2">It doesn't qualify for the free programs</h3>
<p class="text-sm text-on-surface-variant">Wet, disassembled, bedbug, or burned mattresses are refused by Bye Bye Mattress and most city haulers. We take them anyway.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

